<title>USA: Thermo Cardiosystems sets buyback.</title>
<headline>Thermo Cardiosystems sets buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Cardiosystems Inc said Wednesday that its board of directors has authorized the repurchase, through April 1, 1998, of up to $20 million of its own common stock in the open market, or in negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Thermo Cardiosystems said it will repurchase shares when they are available at prices the company considers attractive.</p>
<p>The shares were up 3/8 at 20-5/8 in mid morning trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>Since the last board authorization for a repurchase of up to $10 million of the company's common stock in August 1996, which will expire in August 1997, Thermo Cardiosystems has expended about $5.6 million to repurchase its own securities, the company said.</p>
